      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">وَجِىْءٌ</span></b>  and ↓ <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">مَوْجُوْءٌ</span></b>  A goat <i>on which has been
performed the operation called</i> <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">وَجْءٌ</span>. (K.) [See 1.]
― 
       <p class="alpheios-lex-sense-separator"> </p><span class="alpheios-lex-sense-spacer2"> </span>-b2-  The latter is said to be used in a trad. as
signifying <i>Gelded.</i> ― 
       <p class="alpheios-lex-sense-separator"> </p><span class="alpheios-lex-sense-spacer2"> </span>-b3-  Also the latter, <i>Struck</i>
with a knife. (S.)

